<h3>2026-08-20 — AISYSTEM docs current: Todo-create is code; Scheduler is specified</h3>
<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <p class="doc-body">Plans now separate <strong>built</strong> from <strong>specified</strong>. Todo-create (<a href="/todo/details?record_id=2217">#2217</a>) is Perl in <code>AI2::Chat::process</code> + <code>TodoCreate</code> — a clear “add a todo” does not use the picker. Scheduler (<a href="/todo/details?record_id=2218">#2218</a>) is a separate agent for blocker todos and queue-aware start dates; it is not implemented and must not revive bulk <code>/todo/reschedule</code>. Master Plan and AISYSTEMPlan jump links include both todos (hover explains each). User guide “Adding a Todo” matches this.</p>
